 ## Costs of matching Metal
 
+Dynamically indexed constant tables larger than 4 KiB use the pipeline's shared constant
+buffer. Smaller typed tables stay in private storage while they fit the private-memory limit.
+Constant GEP and pointer-cast expressions retain their byte offsets in either representation.
+This storage choice preserves values and avoids a private copy of a large table per invocation.
